{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17292","headline":"送灵武范司空 · 权德舆","name":"送灵武范司空","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上略在安边，吴钩结束鲜。\n三公临右地，七萃拥中坚。\n旧垒销烽火，新营辨井泉。\n伐谋师以律，贾勇士争先。\n塞迥晴看月，沙平远际天。\n荣薰知屈指，应在盛秋前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17292.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17292","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}